---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Client Clean Architecture layers
    accDescr: Four layers with inward code dependencies. The admin panel provides its own adapters and imports application and domain directly.

    Mobile["4 · Frameworks and drivers<br/>Mobile app · Expo / React Native<br/>Skia, audio and composition root<br/>SQLite (provisional) and HTTP client"]
    Admin["4 · Frameworks and drivers<br/>Admin web panel · React / Vite<br/>Own HTTP and draft-storage adapters"]
    Adapters["3 · Interface adapters<br/>Presenters, input mapping and board projection<br/>Repository adapters, DTO mappers and state serialization"]
    App["2 · Application / Use cases<br/>StartGameUseCase, ApplyMoveUseCase, FinishGameUseCase<br/>Use-case decorators and ports (e.g. IProgressRepository)"]
    Domain["1 · Domain / Entities<br/>Board, GameEngine and variant rules<br/>Geometry, scoring, piece sources, progress and events"]

    Mobile --> Adapters
    Adapters -->|"implements application ports"| App
    App -->|"uses domain abstractions"| Domain
    Admin -->|"@application"| App
    Admin -->|"@domain"| Domain

    classDef drivers fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#7da4d4,color:#14243a
    classDef adapters fill:#edf4ff,stroke:#7da4d4,color:#14243a
    classDef application fill:#edf8f5,stroke:#76a99b,color:#14243a
    classDef domain fill:#e5f3ed,stroke:#58947f,color:#14243a
    class Mobile,Admin drivers
    class Adapters adapters
    class App application
    class Domain domain
